        "correct_answer": "B",
        "explanation": "B is correct because actual cash value is replacement cost reduced by depreciation. A is wrong because the NFIP is not a valued policy. C is wrong because land value is not the ACV measure. D is wrong because a policy limit is the maximum payable amount, not the valuation method."
      }
