    "heading": "4.6 Flood Policy Coverages",
    "body_paragraphs": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The Standard Flood Insurance Policy includes four **coverages**: Coverage A for building property, Coverage B for personal property, Coverage C for other coverages, and Coverage D for Increased Cost of Compliance. You should remember that this is a single-peril policy. It pays for direct physical loss caused by flood, subject to valuation rules, actual damage, and the policy limit, whichever amount is less."
