  {
    "heading": "4.8 Exclusions",
    "body_paragraphs": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Flood coverage only applies to **direct physical loss** by or from flood, so many indirect or economic losses are excluded. You cannot promise payment for lost income, lost access, loss of use, business interruption, or extra living expenses while repairs are underway. Costs to comply with ordinances are also excluded except where Coverage D, Increased Cost of Compliance, applies."
      },
