        "type": "text",
        "content": "You also need to explain water-related exclusions carefully. Sewer backup, sump overflow, seepage, or pressure of water is excluded unless there is a flood in the area and that flood is the proximate cause. Loss from power, heating, or cooling failure is also excluded unless flood directly damages the equipment at the described location."
      },
      {
        "type": "important_callout",
        "content": "Mudflow can be covered as flood, but ordinary landslide or similar earth movement is not."
      },
