        "content": "For NFIP coverage to be available, a community must join the program and adopt floodplain management rules. When they do, FEMA makes flood insurance available for eligible buildings and contents in that community. You also use FEMA flood maps because they help identify hazard areas, support rating, and show lenders when flood insurance purchase rules may apply."
