    "body_paragraphs": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "For the NFIP to operate in a community, local officials must adopt and enforce floodplain rules. In return, FEMA makes flood coverage available in that community. You will use FEMA flood maps to help identify hazard areas, support rating, and understand when lenders may require coverage. State departments of insurance may also expect you to describe these limits accurately to clients."
