        "content": "The Coastal Barrier Resources Act and later amendments limit federal spending, including flood insurance, for certain residential or commercial development in designated high-risk coastal areas. These protected areas include the Coastal Barrier Resources System and Otherwise Protected Areas. Before you discuss coverage, you should check FEMA resources and the Flood Insurance Manual to confirm whether the property is in one of these restricted areas."
