        "content": "The **National Flood Insurance Program (NFIP)** began in 1968. It was created so you can place flood coverage through a national program supported by FEMA and private insurers. It also encourages communities to manage flood-prone land more carefully."
      },
      {
        "type": "bullet_list",
        "items": [
