    "body_paragraphs": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Under the NFIP, a community agrees to adopt and enforce floodplain rules. In return, FEMA makes flood insurance available in that community. You will use FEMA flood maps to identify hazard areas, help support rating, and understand when lenders may require coverage. This community participation is the foundation that lets your clients obtain NFIP protection."
